t: Quinnipiac showed a 19-point lead, Marist and Emerson showed double digits, and the most recent Pollfinity survey showed a narrower 3-point edge. The overall polling average sits around 12 points, in line with New York's Democratic lean plus incumbency. Fundraising slightly favors Hochul, and prediction markets price her win probability in the mid-90s.\n\nExpert raters uniformly place the race in the Safe or Solid Democratic column. The October debate centered on Trump, crime, and affordability, with Blakeman needing to consolidate upstate and suburban voters to close a wide gap. Late movement is possible, but the evidence points to a comfortable Hochul victory.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9859, "margin": 12.77}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9584, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9776, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9779, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9761, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9756, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9778, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9755, "margin": 11.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9799, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9796, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9804, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9807, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9805, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9817, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9754, "margin": 11.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9752, "margin": 11.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.99, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9892, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.9859, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9816, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.9905, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.9862, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.9852, "margin": 12.5}, {"d